----------------------------------------\par
\par
The launcher sends only what it needs to work:\par
- Server status: from Cfx.re and from the Tiflisi 1898 server.\par
- Updates: checks GitHub for new versions.\par
- When you press Join: that server gets the launcher version and which visual mod, if any, is in RedM.\par
- Anonymous stats: while the launcher is open, once a minute the Tiflisi 1898 server gets the launcher version, its language, whether the game is running and a random install number. Turn it off any time: Settings > "Share anonymous launcher stats".\par
\par
Your name, accounts, files and PC details are never sent.\par
